{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"练习","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：练习。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"1. 手算 5+3 的二进制加法，验证半加器全加器逻辑。\n2. 把你的生日转成二进制再转回十进制。\n3. 解释为什么 n 个触发器能存 2ⁿ 种状态。\n4. 用 Python 实现 8 位加法器，算 20+30。\n5. 解释缓存命中为什么让数组比链表快。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「练习」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"练习","slug":"senior-coding-topic-21","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「练习」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":42,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-021-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"515db4e64643c3600e27b843640814df894f10549ca7fb6dc0e66aca13683ed6","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/515db4e64643c360/07-编码.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"练习"},"content_hash":"7f3ea5a2f09049ed578f761057b0eb794fa1d8254169d0739828677e972e08f8","course":{"slug":"senior-coding","title":"编码与计算机系统","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
